Large responses mostly belong to the first token of a document (or its
initial repetitions), not to these characters everywhere. At that boundary,
use digit/indentation/punctuation values and coarse spelling classes. Elsewhere
predict near zero, with small formatting adjustments and a top-level Go-comment
rule. This deliberately does not memorize the idiosyncratic first-word values.
