"""A sparse approximation to rare opening spikes, not a full reconstruction.

Assign large values to selected document-initial number, hydro-, template,
comment, HTML and JavaScript openings. Track only the first token and the
position within the current document. Add rules for middle-dot separators,
chat markers and initial whitespace/punctuation. Most smaller token-specific
variation remains unexplained; the default is almost zero.
